            {
              "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
              "Text": "IANDRA DUAL-PURPOSE CROP RESULTS \n\n2013 \nNITROGEN: Mineral N to 2m: 19/2=90 kg/ha; 7/5=205 kg/ha\n\t\t50 (spring crops)/100 (winter crops) kg N/ha top-dressed post-mowing\nPADDOCK HISTORY:\tLucerne, Removed September 2012\nPREPARATION:\t\tKnock-down, Disk Harrow, Direct drill\n\n2014\nSOIL:\t\t\t\tDeep Red Gradational Clay Loam\n\t\t\t\tSurface 0-10 [pH=5.3; OC=0.8%; P=86 Colwell]\nMINERAL N to 1.6m:\t18 March = 140 kg N/ha; 5 June = 15 kg N/ha (Hyola 971CL), 45 kg N/ha (Wedgetail), 75 kg N/ha (Hyola 575CL sown 1 Apr), 250 kgN/ha (early May sowing)\nPADDOCK HISTORY:\tLucerne, Removed September 2012\n\t\t\t\tCanola/wheat removed September 2013\nPREPARATION:\t\tKnock-down, Disk Harrow, Direct drill\n\n",
